  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "S01",
      "file": "S01.mp3",
      "text": "二零一四年五月，韩国大邱一名二十五岁大学生，站上了终审死刑的被告席。",
      "sha256": "cd015b27712315f5fbec8f3b0a00fc0409449cc1f1c6648df0af0e2f2c8f80a5",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十四期）",
      "narration_id": "S01",
      "target_start": 0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.606,
      "atempo": 1.101,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "file": "S02.mp3",
      "text": "他叫张载振，曾是大学社团社长，也是同学眼中的优等生。",
      "sha256": "be37f96f91506b382b1326268d086e4e200db65464c5896306f0dd9af6fac1db",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十四期）",
      "narration_id": "S02",
      "target_start": 6,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.631,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.369
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "text": "在学校里，他认识了性格温和的女生权某，两人很快发展成恋人关系。",
      "sha256": "14c126faafc5466af96faf1e11f4980d7e9859dd06d9267cc5028ef03ddd9d50",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十四期）",
      "narration_id": "S03",
      "target_start": 12,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 7.21,
      "atempo": 1.2016,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "可相处久了，权某发现张载振控制欲极强，稍有不顺就会情绪失控。",
      "sha256": "79f04da6def832cfeaa0d4a88ae1e4bd64e2324df532ce064c3205255c2e0520",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十四期）",
      "narration_id": "S04",
      "target_start": 18,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 7.338,
      "atempo": 1.2229,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "权某鼓起勇气提出分手，她的父母也坚决反对女儿继续和张载振来往。",
      "sha256": "0589c5e061c3466f075e60c162f44e88d66ed1f409807d371f99f23eedb6eca0",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十四期）",
      "narration_id": "S05",
      "target_start": 24,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.095,
      "atempo": 1.0159,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "谁也没想到，这一句再正常不过的分手，竟点燃了张载振心底的杀机。",
      "sha256": "3d02adf2b0c11302ea5f574e283c7271ebff0072fe6eaaf6d2121023b7602315",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十四期）",
      "narration_id": "S06",
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 7.036,
      "atempo": 1.1726,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "他开始疯狂跟踪权某，甚至摸清了她父母每天出门和下班的精确时间。",
      "sha256": "3c47b16974345c96202a8a007daa0b42e156d95632811ba45fbff8d3bfcaea48",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十四期）",
      "narration_id": "S07",
      "target_start": 36,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.41,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.59
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "几天后，张载振穿上一身深蓝色工服，拎着一只沉甸甸的黑色工具箱。",
      "sha256": "8b10184212cd0a04231b04a6fcefe010f0bc44a5ae6988dee60ac4a229ab8bb5",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十四期）",
      "narration_id": "S08",
      "target_start": 42,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 7.21,
      "atempo": 1.2016,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "他冒充成上门检修管道的修理工，平静地敲响了权某父母家的防盗门。",
      "sha256": "e784b49989db535f631b443bb8da7477013a4bdd5fb6cc918542911a841a0b3b",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十四期）",
      "narration_id": "S09",
      "target_start": 48,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.8,
      "atempo": 1.1333,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "毫不知情的权某父母打开了门，把这名曾经的准女婿迎进了客厅。",
      "sha256": "fa7d9e8b52aca9a9a9a7e85e0ed1f03bf844f259b23ba7f90a40f942e5c8821a",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十四期）",
      "narration_id": "S10",
      "target_start": 54,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.793,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.207
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "进屋之后，张载振撕下伪装，在客厅里导致权某父母双双遇难。",
      "sha256": "f52f7ae5844c9b22d51c924b8327dc04f26cc6caa3cf6530f2cde2c7340299c3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十四期）",
      "narration_id": "S11",
      "target_start": 60,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 7.117,
      "atempo": 1.1862,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "更令人毛骨悚然的是，作案后他没有逃跑，而是冷静地把房间清理了一遍。",
      "sha256": "1dbd5e4ef044d28f7fddbe8689d68fd636eb4d201591aafe5b173048dd34a8a2",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十四期）",
      "narration_id": "S12",
      "target_start": 66,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 7.5,
      "atempo": 1.25,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "他反锁好防盗门，独自坐在黑暗的客厅里，安静地等待权某下班回家。",
      "sha256": "34d5a4c2ecb3c77bc84f26433e2dfa78d1618b0bc88e3888af6e028d4697bc20",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十四期）",
      "narration_id": "S13",
      "target_start": 72,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 8.313,
      "atempo": 1.3855,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "file": "S14.mp3",
      "text": "深夜时分，权某像往常一样用钥匙打开家门，迎面却撞上了黑暗中的他。",
      "sha256": "5f1b899349332319408f49b1101a8417563d26633c3c94b753eef7cc81534a13",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十四期）",
      "narration_id": "S14",
      "target_start": 78,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.432,
      "atempo": 1.072,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "file": "S15.mp3",
      "text": "面对早已失去理智的张载振，权某在生死关头拼尽全力挣脱控制。",
      "sha256": "2a6d423797abc357fff1c95c072761fb59e3892c12ddc01e3cffd0163d2b8b41",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十四期）",
      "narration_id": "S15",
      "target_start": 84,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.827,
      "atempo": 1.1378,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "file": "S16.mp3",
      "text": "她一路狂奔冲出单元门大声呼救，惊醒了整栋公寓的邻居并立刻报警。",
      "sha256": "0b0cf874a23ee644f57bc7f1848f913f7ba089784760bafb13c823f9c5c91507",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十四期）",
      "narration_id": "S16",
      "target_start": 90,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 7.21,
      "atempo": 1.2016,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "file": "S17.mp3",
      "text": "韩国警方火速赶到现场封锁楼道，很快将还没来得及逃远的张载振抓获。",
      "sha256": "e3a1ea5282ffd1561fe6d1f70ae103a3f6bec24edf559a6fc19f92cfce881174",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十四期）",
      "narration_id": "S17",
      "target_start": 96,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.432,
      "atempo": 1.072,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "file": "S18.mp3",
      "text": "消息传回大学校园，所有认识张载振的老师和同学都觉得难以置信。",
      "sha256": "df8de29483817a34bc4831319f6c99302e5860b4d9d6ba7ea77423062b098282",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十四期）",
      "narration_id": "S18",
      "target_start": 102,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.223,
      "atempo": 1.0372,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "file": "S19.mp3",
      "text": "那个平时看起来彬彬有礼的大学社长，背地里竟然藏着如此极端的偏执。",
      "sha256": "0172b59e0ebd86b20b7883eeba18287a1bc6eca84cbaff46e85f3591a2ca9595",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十四期）",
      "narration_id": "S19",
      "target_start": 108,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.014,
      "atempo": 1.0023,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "file": "S20.mp3",
      "text": "面对铁证，张载振在法庭上竟然试图用饮酒和精神恍惚来替自己脱罪。",
      "sha256": "06a1cafc5d6908cb6620375d639b65ec64e0e03f8ed8b352bc4232ab1e50907d",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十四期）",
      "narration_id": "S20",
      "target_start": 114,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.734,
      "atempo": 1.1223,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "file": "S21.mp3",
      "text": "但检方调取了他提前购买工具、伪装修理工的监控，彻底戳穿了他的谎言。",
      "sha256": "bacea5c2ba4140ad777dcc4f5b6d4eef138b0a373d802da91df42dc3c70cf710",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十四期）",
      "narration_id": "S21",
      "target_start": 120,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 7.338,
      "atempo": 1.2229,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "file": "S22.mp3",
      "text": "一审法庭认为他犯罪手段极其残忍、毫无悔意，直接判处张载振死刑。",
      "sha256": "b2270f1d21e3bd1e0e4d2607ea20734fcc972d16b35d3648c4baa4df41f630cf",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十四期）",
      "narration_id": "S22",
      "target_start": 126,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.827,
      "atempo": 1.1378,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "file": "S23.mp3",
      "text": "张载振不服判决提起上诉，然而二审法院毫不犹豫地驳回上诉维持原判。",
      "sha256": "01c63ea8a7890b9ca0507321197879ce7381961b57f623518212d019f7132f93",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十四期）",
      "narration_id": "S23",
      "target_start": 132,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.827,
      "atempo": 1.1378,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "file": "S24.mp3",
      "text": "二零一五年，韩国大法院终审维持死刑判决，张载振彻底失去了翻盘机会。",
      "sha256": "8cf1a983fc9237eaf0ba5237d3b87c5ebf2da0802af85082d94e22f34b6a8c5d",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十四期）",
      "narration_id": "S24",
      "target_start": 138,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 8.916,
      "atempo": 1.4861,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "file": "S25.mp3",
      "text": "当时年仅二十五岁的他，就此成为韩国最年轻的死刑犯。",
      "sha256": "4f67628b76420e862b641f473052c4e8f5cdceef2e9c86efa9a3738cd8bc9550",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十四期）",
      "narration_id": "S25",
      "target_start": 144,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.725,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.275
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "file": "S26.mp3",
      "text": "由于韩国自一九九七年底后再未实际执行过死刑，他至今仍被关在死囚牢房。",
      "sha256": "8be0208d8ab92a2cc7ba96a41a12a0b4e7c5ff00f7314057b0c96fb50fa088d5",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十四期）",
      "narration_id": "S26",
      "target_start": 150,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 8.394,
      "atempo": 1.399,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S27",
      "file": "S27.mp3",
      "text": "一次失控的分手，毁掉了一个原本幸福的家庭，也葬送了他自己的人生。",
      "sha256": "92aa5d09222b7a40372f32fe81c9f8a5b31c111cf60521851adc97d4c679eb0d",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十四期）",
      "narration_id": "S27",
      "target_start": 156,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.908,
      "atempo": 1.1513,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S28",
      "file": "S28.mp3",
      "text": "真正的爱从来不是占有，当一个人把分手当成背叛，悲剧就已经注定。",
      "sha256": "dc357211d826210ac8f68a01f2ba0f6f936e96a8883a361fee1edfe8c722ab67",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十四期）",
      "narration_id": "S28",
      "target_start": 162,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.304,
      "atempo": 1.0507,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S29",
      "file": "S29.mp3",
      "text": "从受人尊敬的大学社长到终身囚禁的死刑犯，中间隔着的只是一念之差。",
